periods.description:
Set a name, start/end time, weekdays and price source for every period. Use 00:00 as midnight; 24:00 is also accepted as an end boundary. All periods together must cover the full week without overlaps.

Validation: {schedule_error}

You will then configure only the price field matching the selected source. A selected sensor is exclusive: unavailable or invalid readings leave affected energy unpriced and never fall back to the manual price.
